			3 => ['How many kilometres do you travel by car/motorcycle to reach your workplace/school (one way only)?', 'Please specify exactly the number of km travelled by private vehicle, excluding sections covered by other means of transport, in order to correctly calculate the environmental impact.', '<2 km|2,1-5 km|5,1-10 km|10,1-15 km|15,1-25 km|25,1-50 km|50,1-75 km|75,1-100 km|100,1-125 km|125,1-150 km|>150 km|Invalid data'],
