			5 => ['What time do you usually leave for your commute?', '', 'before 6:30|between 6:30 and 6:45|between 6:45 and 7:00|between 7:00 and 7:15|between 7:15 and 7:30|between 7:30 and 7:45|between 7:45 and 8:00|between 8:00 and 8:15|between 8:15 and 8:30|between 8:30 and 8:45|between 8:45 and 9:00|after 9:00|shift work|schedule based on lessons'],
			6 => ['How many minutes does your WORK-HOME commute take on average, including any stops', '', 'less than 15 minutes|more than 90 minutes|between 15 and 30 minutes|between 30 and 45 minutes|between 45 and 60 minutes|between 60 and 75 minutes|between 75 and 90 minutes'],
