			8 => ['What time do you usually leave work on Fridays?', '', 'before 14:00|from 14:00 to 14:30|from 14:30 to 15:00|from 15:30 to 16:00|from 16:00 to 16:30|from 16:30 to 17:00|from 17:00 to 17:30|from 17:30 to 18:00|from 18:00 to 18:30|from 18:30 to 19:00|after 19:00'],
			9 => ['During your commute, either going or returning, do you carry out other activities (e.g. errands, grocery shopping, sports, taking children to school, etc.)?', '', 'Yes, on the way there|Yes, on the way back|Yes, both on the way there and back|Yes, only sometimes|No'],
			10 => ['For the round-trip commute, which mode of transport do you mainly use in winter months?', 'Consider the main mode of transport as the one you use to cover the greatest number of kilometres', 'On foot|Bus/Tram|Metro|Car|Motorcycle|Bicycle|Kick scooter|Taxi|Train|Railway service other operators (Trenord, Italo, Alta Velocità...)|Car sharing|Bike sharing|Motorcycle sharing|Kick scooter sharing|Company shuttle|Car pooling'],
