			30 => ['How would you be willing to travel in a car pooling crew?', '', 'Both as driver and as passenger|Only as driver|Only as passenger'],
			31 => ['On which days of the week do you use or would you use car pooling?', 'Multiple answers possible', 'Monday|Tuesday|Wednesday|Thursday|Friday|Saturday|Sunday'],
			32 => ['By how much would you be willing to increase the duration of your HOME-WORK commute (driving alone) by using Car Pooling? At most...', '', '10 minutes|15 minutes|5 minutes'],
			33 => ['Would you be willing to sign up for a car sharing service?', 'Multiple answers possible', 'Yes|Yes, if there were a station near my home/workplace|Yes, if my home/workplace were within the service\'s operating area |I don\'t know the service|No'],
			35 => ['Which transport modes do you use in summer for your commute?', 'Multiple answers possible', 'The same ones I use in winter months|On foot|Bus/tram|Metro GTT|Car|Motorcycle/Scooter|Bicycle|Kick scooter|Taxi |Company shuttle|Trenitalia/GTT railway service|Other railway service (Trenord, Italo, Alta velocità, ...)|Car sharing|Bike sharing|Motorcycle sharing|Car pooling'],
			36 => ['Under what conditions would you cycle to work?', '', 'If there were cycling routes|If facilities useful for cycling were available at the workplace (bike racks, shelters, changing rooms, showers)|If it were possible to reach the workplace directly|If there were an adequate park-and-ride facility with public transport (e.g. at the station)|If there were adequate parking at the workplace|If I could have an incentive for purchasing a bicycle|Only in summer months|Never'],
			37 => ['Would you be interested in trying "smart working" arrangements', 'Yes, but only if the company provided me with the necessary tools. Yes, if the company contributed to expenses (e.g. internet connection, electricity, etc.). No, never. I would be interested in working at a coworking office near home', '{"groups": [{"label": "Other", "options": ["my job does not allow it", "impossible due to the nature of my job", "I already work at a coworking office", "I work off the books on a permanent basis", "I am already doing it", "I would like to but as an educator unfortunately it is quite unlikely to ever happen", "not feasible"]}], "allowOther": true}'],
