			188 => ['What type of schedule do you have?', '', 'Daily|Vertical part-time|Horizontal part-time|Credit - Debit'],
			189 => ['Do you work shifts?', 'According to Legislative Decree No. 66 of 8 April 2003 ("Implementation of Directives 93/104/EC and 2000/34/EC concerning certain aspects of the organisation of working time"), the following is meant by: "shift work" any method of organising work, also in teams, whereby workers are successively assigned to the same workplaces according to a set pattern, including a rotating pattern, which may be continuous or discontinuous, and which requires workers to carry out work at different times over a set period of days or weeks.', 'Yes, on a fixed shift (I always work the same shift)|Yes, on a variable shift (I alternate morning, afternoon, evening/night)|No'],
