			358 => ['What is the destination of your commute?', 'Is it possible to reach your school safely by bicycle? If yes, do you use it? If no, would you use it?', 'there are bike lanes and I use them|there are bike lanes but I don\'t use them|there are bike lanes but only on some stretches, and the roads are very busy, it is not safe to cycle to work|there are no bike lanes, but if there were I would definitely use them|there are no bike lanes, but if there were I would use them occasionally|there are no bike lanes, but even if there were I wouldn\'t use them anyway'],
