			525 => ['Why?', 'Choose only one of the following:', 'A parent|Grandparents or uncles/aunts|A brother / a sister|Goes with friends|Goes to school alone|Other'],
			526 => ['To understand safety around the school, when you arrive or leave school, do you stop to wait or talk with friends near the school?', '', 'On foot|By bicycle|By train|By bus|By car|By moped/motorcycle|With multiple modes of transport|Other'],
			527 => ['Is the space where you stop safe and protected from traffic?', '', 'It\'s more fun|It\'s more comfortable|It\'s less dangerous|It takes me less time|I am more independent|Other'],
			528 => ['What would be needed to allow students to walk to school safely?', '', 'Yes|No'],
			529 => ['What would be needed to allow students to cycle to school safely?', '', 'Yes|No'],
			530 => ['What annoys you the most among the following?', '', 'Yes|No'],
			531 => ['How would you solve the traffic and pollution problem?', '', 'Yes, I changed my habits and now I go to school on foot/by bike or by public transport|Yes, I come by car, but I walk or cycle at least the last 200 meters|No, because I already went to school on foot/by bike or with local public transport|No, my commuting habits have not changed|I wouldn\'t know'],
			532 => ['In your opinion, in the streets around the school, WALKING', 'Multiple answers possible', 'More protected pedestrian paths (e.g. with barriers preventing cars from occupying pedestrian spaces, with raised intersections to ensure cars slow down where students cross the road)|More traffic calming measures|Presence of adults helping students cross at the most dangerous spots|Other'],
			533 => ['Why?', 'Multiple answers possible', 'More cycling paths protected from car lanes|More traffic calming measures|Presence of adults helping students cross at the most dangerous spots|Availability of convenient, safe, and covered bicycle parking at school|Other'],
			534 => ['In the streets around the school, taking the SCHOOL BUS or BUS:', 'Multiple answers possible', 'Traffic and queues|Risk of accidents and poor road safety|Air and noise pollution|Boring and unattractive routes|Difficulty walking or cycling (cars too fast or parked on the sidewalk)|Other'],
			535 => ['Why do you go by car?', 'Multiple answers possible', 'More public transport|Cheaper public transport tickets|More routes reserved exclusively for public transport|More car-free zones|More cycling paths|Other'],
			536 => ['In the streets around the school, CYCLING:', '', 'It is safe|It\'s dangerous'],
			537 => ['How come?', 'Multiple answers possible', 'Because pedestrian paths (sidewalks or spaces reserved for pedestrians) do not exist or are narrow or unprotected|Because on pedestrian paths there are elements that make passage risky (potholes, protruding roots, or other)|Because on pedestrian paths there are obstacles blocking the way (poles, dumpsters, or other)|Because vehicle speed puts everyone at risk (pedestrians, cyclists, other drivers)|Because at crossings vehicles do not follow the rules (they neither stop nor slow down)|Because the streets are poorly lit|Because along the streets there are few shops or other landmarks (library, youth center, community center, etc.)'],
			538 => ['How come?', '', 'Because there are no cycling paths|Because cycling paths are not separated from vehicle lanes|Because there are potholes or manholes on the roadway|Because there are dumpsters or other obstacles blocking the roadway|Because vehicle speed puts everyone at risk (pedestrians, cyclists, other drivers)|Because at intersections vehicles do not follow the rules (they neither stop nor slow down)|Because the streets are poorly lit'],
			539 => ['Would you be willing to use a more environmentally sustainable transport mode?', '', 'It is safe|It\'s dangerous|There are no buses/school buses'],
			540 => ['Would you (or the person who accompanies you) be willing to leave the car 300 metres from the school entrance and walk the last stretch?', '', 'Because the stop lacks a safe waiting area|Because the stop is not clearly visible/signposted|Because the stop lacks a safe pedestrian crossing nearby|Because vehicle speed puts everyone at risk (pedestrians, cyclists, other drivers)|Because the stretch of road is poorly lit'],
			541 => ['Would you be willing to form a "car pooling" arrangement by offering or accepting a ride in a colleague\'s/classmate\'s car, with a minor detour from your current route?', 'Multiple answers possible', 'Out of habit and convenience|Out of necessity|Due to health issues|Due to safety concerns'],
			542 => ['Do you reside in the same province where the office you are assigned to is located?', '', 'It is safe|It\'s dangerous'],
			543 => ['Does your work arrangement include smart working?', 'Multiple answers possible', 'it takes less time and I can get up later|my parents pass by school on the way to work / as a parent going to work I already pass near school|the car is needed by me / by whoever accompanies me for other activities (shopping, gym…)'],
			544 => ['On which days do you usually go to the office?', 'Multiple answers possible', 'There is no public transport stop within 5 minutes walking from home/school or public transport comes too early/late|Arriving at school on foot/by bicycle or by public transport would make me late (for school / for work)'],
			545 => ['How much does the time spent commuting home-work and work-home impact your personal life (hobbies, sports, leisure)?', 'Multiple answers possible', 'Because pedestrian paths (sidewalks or spaces reserved for pedestrians) / cycling paths do not exist|Because cycling paths are not separated from vehicle lanes|Because there are potholes or manholes on the roadway|Because there are dumpsters or other obstacles blocking the roadway|Because vehicle speed puts everyone at risk (pedestrians, cyclists, other drivers)|Because at crossings vehicles do not follow the rules (they neither stop nor slow down)|Because the streets are poorly lit|Because along the streets there are few shops or other landmarks (library, youth center, community center, etc.)'],
			546 => ['Is your usual commuting mode a source of stress for you?', '', 'Yes|Only if it took me at most 10 minutes more|Only if the route were safe for pedestrians / cyclists|No'],
