1 = not at all satisfied, 5 = completely satisfied', '1|2|3|4|5'],
			581 => ['Under what conditions would you be willing to share your car ride with colleagues (car pooling) for your home-work commute at least 3 days a week?', '', 'Yes|No'],
			582 => ['Under what conditions would you be willing to use a bicycle for your home-work commute at least 3 days a week?', '', 'On foot (> 5min)|Pedal / electric bicycle or kick scooter|Company shuttle|Public transport (bus, metro, train)|Sharing the car with colleagues (car pooling)|Car or motorcycle'],
			583 => ['Under what conditions would you be interested in a company shuttle service?', '', 'By choice or company policy|Out of habit (I have never considered or tried alternatives)|Transporting materials or work tools|Because it is the fastest means of transport|Because it is the only means to reach the destination|For travel comfort (e.g. I am not disturbed by others, cool in summer and warm in winter, sheltered from rain, no walking stretches, etc.)'],
			584 => ['Which initiatives would you be interested in?', '', 'On foot (> 5min)|Pedal / electric bicycle or kick scooter|Company shuttle|Public transport (bus, metro, train)|Sharing the car with colleagues (car pooling)|Car or motorcycle'],
			585 => ['Indicate the Mobility Management initiatives you are interested in', '', 'Out of habit (I have never considered or tried alternatives)|Due to my reduced physical or sensory mobility|For the ease of parking|For reasons of time and/or reliability|Because I need it for my work activities|For work-life balance needs (e.g. accompanying family members, trips during lunch break, etc.)|For travel comfort (e.g. I travel alone and seated, I am not disturbed by others, transport objects, cool in summer and warm in winter, sheltered from rain, no walking stretches, etc.)|Other reason'],
			586 => ['What issues do you encounter during your usual home-work commute?', '', 'I do not regularly use a car or motorcycle|No, I am not available|Yes, under certain conditions'],
			587 => ['Do you have any ideas or suggestions?', '', 'Nearest bus stop to the workplace entrances|Nearest bus stop to my home|More frequent services|Higher frequencies during evening and night hours|Greater schedule flexibility to be able to access services (e.g. train, suburban service, etc.)|Allocation of rewards or financial recognition|Free or discounted use of services|No conditions, I am not willing to use public transport'],
			588 => ['What mode of transport do you mainly use during business trips?', '', 'I know well and can independently use the transport network and access tools (e.g. RERpp!)|I only know the metro line and the bus line near my home|I don\'t know it, but I would like to learn more'],
			589 => ['Why do you choose this mode for business trips?', '', 'Knowledge of and familiarity with potential travel companions|Greater schedule flexibility to allow coordination of schedules among colleagues|Availability of a digital platform for ride sharing|Availability of company cars for car pooling|Availability of parking spots reserved for car pooling at the workplace|Allocation of rewards and/or financial incentives for carpoolers|No conditions, I am not willing to carpool'],
			590 => ['Where do you go most frequently for business purposes?', '', 'Improvement of safety conditions on the route I have to travel|Availability of a free company electric bicycle sharing and/or booking service|Availability of a company electric bicycle assigned to me for exclusive use|Availability of bicycle racks and/or covered and secure parking spaces at the workplace|Availability of charging stations for electric bicycles at the workplace|Availability of lockers / showers / changing rooms at the workplace|Availability of bicycle maintenance / repair stations at the workplace|Availability of financial incentives for bicycle purchase|Allocation of rewards and/or mileage reimbursements for bicycle use|No conditions, I am not willing to use a bicycle|No conditions, I am unable to use a bicycle'],
			591 => ['Under what conditions would you be willing to change your habits for business trips?', '', 'Free service|Shorter travel time compared to a private car|Less parking difficulty compared to a private car|Frequent service available at any time|Home delivery service|No conditions, I am not interested'],
			592 => ['How do you most frequently get to work?', '', 'Meetings on strategies for sustainable urban mobility|Training meetings on RER transport services|Introductory meetings on company strategies for commuting|Group activities, guided tours, bike rides, etc. on the topic of sustainable mobility|Eco-Driving courses|Community and Groups for the use of different services|Promotion of public transport use with subsidies or company transit passes|“Bike to work” projects with incentives or benefits|Company bike sharing or shared electric kick scooter services|Company or inter-company shuttle services to public transport hubs|Company parking spaces dedicated to those who carpool|Workshop on well-being and safety related to home-work commuting|Challenges and rewards for those who adopt sustainable modes|Individual mobility counseling desks|Company themed days (Bike Day, Mobility Day, Car Free Day)|Other'],
			593 => ['Which alternative modes would you use for your home-work commute?', '', 'Meetings on strategies for sustainable urban mobility|Training meetings on RER transport services|Introductory meetings on company strategies for commuting|Group activities, guided tours, bike rides, etc. on the topic of sustainable mobility|Eco-Driving courses|Community and Groups for the use of different services|Promotion of public transport use with subsidies or company transit passes|“Bike to work” projects with incentives or benefits|Company bike sharing or shared electric kick scooter services|Company or inter-company shuttle services to public transport hubs|Company parking spaces dedicated to those who carpool|Workshop on well-being and safety related to home-work commuting|Challenges and rewards for those who adopt sustainable modes|Individual mobility counseling desks|Company themed days (Bike Day, Mobility Day, Car Free Day)|Other'],
			594 => ['% CAR', '', 'Meetings on strategies for sustainable urban mobility|Training meetings on RER transport services|Introductory meetings on company strategies for commuting|Group activities, guided tours, bike rides, etc. on the topic of sustainable mobility|Eco-Driving courses|Community and Groups for the use of different services|Promotion of public transport use with subsidies or company transit passes|“Bike to work” projects with incentives or benefits|Company bike sharing or shared electric kick scooter services|Company or inter-company shuttle services to public transport hubs|Company parking spaces dedicated to those who carpool|Workshop on well-being and safety related to home-work commuting|Challenges and rewards for those who adopt sustainable modes|Individual mobility counseling desks|Company themed days (Bike Day, Mobility Day, Car Free Day)|Other'],
			595 => ['% BICYCLE', '', 'Meetings on strategies for sustainable urban mobility|Training meetings on RER transport services|Introductory meetings on company strategies for commuting|Group activities, guided tours, bike rides, etc. on the topic of sustainable mobility|Eco-Driving courses|Community and Groups for the use of different services|Promotion of public transport use with subsidies or company transit passes|“Bike to work” projects with incentives or benefits|Company bike sharing or shared electric kick scooter services|Company or inter-company shuttle services to public transport hubs|Company parking spaces dedicated to those who carpool|Workshop on well-being and safety related to home-work commuting|Challenges and rewards for those who adopt sustainable modes|Individual mobility counseling desks|Company themed days (Bike Day, Mobility Day, Car Free Day)|Other'],
			596 => ['How do you get to school?', '', 'On foot (> 5min)|Pedal / electric bicycle, cargo-bike or kick scooter|Public transport (bus, metro, train)|Sharing the car with colleagues (car pooling)|Motor vehicle or motorcycle'],
			597 => ['Which transport mode would you like to use to get to school?', '', 'By choice or company policy|Out of habit (I have never considered or tried alternatives)|Transporting materials or work tools|Because it is the fastest means of transport|Because it is the only means to reach the destination|For travel comfort (e.g. I am not disturbed by others, cool in summer and warm in winter, sheltered from rain, no walking stretches, etc.)'],
			598 => ['Why?', '', 'Destination within the city|Destination outside the city|Construction sites or inspections in hard-to-reach areas'],
			599 => ['How do you get to work?', '', 'If a company fleet of electric bicycles were available|If I had a public transport subscription available|If the company supported me in planning my commute by public transport|If there were a system for managing / booking / organizing trips with colleagues (company car pooling)|If I could benefit from adequate or greater schedule flexibility|If I were prevented from using my car|I am not willing to change my habits'],
			600 => ['How do you get to work?', '', 'If a company fleet of electric cargo bikes were available|If there were a system for managing / booking / organizing trips with colleagues (company car pooling)|If I could benefit from adequate or greater schedule flexibility|I am not willing to change my habits'],
			601 => ['How often do you travel for business purposes?', '', 'Never or occasionally (no more than 2 or 3 times a month)|Frequently (a few days a week)|Always (all or almost all days of my working week)'],
			602 => ['Questionnaire administration to employees', '', 'Yes|No'],
